From: Zizheng Guo <gzz_2000@126.com>
Subject: [PATCH] zink: take Vulkan's entry points from an embedder

Zink loads the Vulkan loader, libvulkan, by name. TTC's GPU renderer links
MoltenVK into ttcd instead, so that ttcd loads no library but Apple's, and
wraps a few of its entry points. An embedder that links Vulkan now sets
zink_vk_get_instance_proc_addr and zink_vk_get_device_proc_addr before it
creates a screen, and Zink calls Vulkan through them.

